B.apX=new A.jW("Collection sync","Your collection is kept on this device and synced to your account, so it follows you to other phones. Changes made offline wait here and upload when you are back online.",B.anw,null,null)
B.apY=new A.jW("Building your deck","Tap a slot to build a bey part by part, or roll random ones. Random beys come from the whole part catalog by default; the tune button lets you limit them to a generation or manufacturer, or roll from your saved combos instead.\n\nEvery slot stays editable after a roll.",B.ho,null,null)
B.apZ=new A.jW("Your tests","Tests are saved on this device only. Every battle you record is saved right away, so nothing is lost if the app closes.\n\nBackup (the cloud button) uploads a private copy to your account, so you can restore your tests on another phone. Nobody else can see them.",B.nb,null,null)
