B.aq4=new A.jW("Battle log","Newest first. Each battle keeps the exact builds, stadium, launchers and side it was recorded with, so changing your setup later never changes old battles.\n\nTap a battle to fix its result, side or note.",B.alJ,null,null)
B.aq8=new A.jW("Scoring","Spin finish 1 point, Over finish 2, Burst finish 2, Xtreme finish 3. A draw scores nothing.\n\nEvery battle is saved on this device the moment you tap it.",B.Ir,null,null)
B.aqb=new A.jW("How testing works","Add an opponent, then record each battle: who won and how (Spin 1, Over 2, Burst 2, Xtreme 3 points), or a draw. Each battle keeps both builds by their part ids, plus the stadium, launchers and your launch side. Records and stats are worked out from the battles you recorded.\n\nEverything is saved on this device as you go.",B.nb,null,null)
